  m_text: '-If Santa Wild apperars where there are already Gift Wilds, multipliers
    get added to the reel.

    -x2 is awarded if there was one Gift Wild, and x3
    is awarded if there were two Gift Wilds on the reel.

    -When there are multiple
    multipliers in the reel, they are added to be multiplied to total pay.'
